    {
      "_id": "6ae899be6ca7b35c362e0189",
      "title": "북한이 연루된 것으로 지목된 63억 달러 바이낸스 해킹, 사상 최대 암호화폐 강탈",
      "message": "<article class=\"nv-text\">\n<p class=\"nv-cover\"><img class=\"nv-cover-img\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JkSIbEqtpfU/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"북한이 연루된 것으로 지목된 63억 달러 바이낸스 해킹, 사상 최대 암호화폐 강탈\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<div class=\"nv-lead\">\n<p class=\"nv-lead-text\">북한이 연루된 것으로 지목된 약 63억 달러 규모 바이낸스 해킹을 다룬 The Guardian 기사에서 핵심 시사 영단어를 정리합니다. *AI 음성과 이미지를 사용했습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nv-body\">\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">North Korean group blamed for $6.3bn Binance hack in biggest ever crypto <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">heist</mark>.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">사상 최대 규모의 암호화폐 강탈로 기록된 바이낸스 해킹에 북한 조직이 연루된 것으로 지목됐다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. heist: 강탈, 대규모 절도 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">...with experts identifying North Korea as the likely <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">culprit</mark>.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">전문가들은 북한을 유력한 범인으로 지목했다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. culprit: 범인, 장본인 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Chainalysis, another analysis <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">outfit</mark>, also attributed the heist to TraderTraitor.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">또 다른 분석 업체인 체인얼리시스도 이번 강탈을 트레이더트레이터의 소행으로 보았다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. outfit: 조직, 업체 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">An initial investigation suggested the <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">breach</mark> may have started with a hacked laptop...</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">초기 조사에서는 보안 침해가 해킹된 노트북에서 시작됐을 가능성이 제기됐다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. breach: 보안 침해, 위반 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">It later resumed trading and said it would fully <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">reimburse</mark> affected traders.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">이후 거래가 재개됐고, 피해를 본 거래자들에게 전액 배상하겠다고 밝혔다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. reimburse: 배상하다, 돈을 돌려주다 (동)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">it had worked with the cryptocurrency <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">custodian</mark> BitGo to freeze funds stolen in what it described as a Binance hack.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">바이낸스 해킹으로 도난당한 자금을 동결하기 위해 암호화폐 수탁 기관 빗고와 협력했다고 전했다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. custodian: 자산 수탁 기관, 관리인 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">the security breach was likely to have wider <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">ramification</mark>s for crypto...</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">이번 보안 침해는 암호화폐 시장에 더 넓은 파장을 일으킬 가능성이 있다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. ramification: 파장, 여파 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">It may further <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">dampen</mark> risk appetite...</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">이는 위험 선호 더 약화시킬 수 있다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. dampen: 약화시키다, 꺾다 (동)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"nv-related-links\">\n<p class=\"nv-related-link-line\"><a class=\"nv-related-link nv-related-link--youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JkSIbEqtpfU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📺</span> 유튜브 보기</a></p>\n<div class=\"board-comments-root nv-related-comments\" data-board-comments-root></div>\n</footer>\n<footer class=\"nv-source\">\n  <p class=\"nv-source-label\">출처</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-text\">The Guardian | North Korean group blamed for $6.3bn Binance hack in biggest ever crypto heist | By Dan Milmo and agencies | Oct. 30, 2026</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-link-wrap\"><a class=\"nv-source-link\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/oct/29/binance-crypto-exchange-hack\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">원문 기사 보기</a></p>\n</footer>\n</article>",
      "slug": "heist-culprit-outfit-breach-reimburse-custodian-ramification-dampen-related-words",
