    {
      "_id": "6ae89d226ca7b35c362e0449",
      "title": "2,000달러짜리 새 아이폰 듀오를 개봉했는데 고장이 났다",
      "message": "<article class=\"nv-text\">\n<p class=\"nv-cover\"><img class=\"nv-cover-img\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nhzRfKKfoAE/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"2,000달러짜리 새 아이폰 듀오를 개봉했는데 고장이 났다\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<div class=\"nv-lead\">\n<p class=\"nv-lead-text\">약 2,000달러짜리 새 아이폰 듀오를 개봉하자마자 힌지와 화면이 고장 났다는 소비자 사례를 다룬 The Wall Street Journal 기사에서 핵심 시사 영단어를 정리합니다. *AI 음성과 이미지를 사용했습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nv-body\">\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">the <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">hinge</mark> got stuck at a 45-degree angle</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. hinge: 경첩, 접히는 연결 부품 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">one along the <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">crease</mark></p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. crease: 접힌 자국, 주름 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">The consistency points to a possible sensitivity in the hinge <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">tolerance</mark>s</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. tolerance: 허용 오차 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">trapped <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">debris</mark> or a manufacturing defect in the hinge could damage the flexible display</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. debris: 이물질, 작은 파편 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">In other words, bendy screens are <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">delicate</mark>.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. delicate: 연약한, 손상되기 쉬운 (형)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Dalton tried to <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">pry</mark> it open and heard a loud pop.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. pry: 힘을 주어 벌리다, 비집어 열다 (동)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">If this mechanism breaks, it could <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">sever</mark> critical circuits</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. sever: 끊다, 절단하다 (동)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">I haven’t experienced sticky hinges or <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">faulty</mark> displays.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. faulty: 결함이 있는 (형)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">a manufacturing <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">defect</mark> in the hinge could damage the flexible display</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. defect: 결함, 하자 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Are these units just <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">lemon</mark>s—or are they part of a systemic issue?</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. lemon: 불량품 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">the batteries are secured with an <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">adhesive</mark> that doesn’t require prying or alcohol</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. adhesive: 접착제 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Mokhtari did say the Duo is the most <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">repairable</mark> foldable he’s inspected.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. repairable: 수리할 수 있는 (형)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">The entry process was <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">straightforward</mark></p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. straightforward: 복잡하지 않은, 간단한 (형)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"nv-related-links\">\n<p class=\"nv-related-link-line\"><a class=\"nv-related-link nv-related-link--youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nhzRfKKfoAE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📺</span> 유튜브 보기</a></p>\n<div class=\"board-comments-root nv-related-comments\" data-board-comments-root></div>\n</footer>\n<footer class=\"nv-source\">\n  <p class=\"nv-source-label\">출처</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-text\">The Wall Street Journal | ‘I Felt Blind Panic.’ They Opened Their New $2,000 iPhone Duo—and It Broke. | By Nicole Nguyen | Oct. 27, 2026</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-link-wrap\"><a class=\"nv-source-link\" href=\"https://www.wsj.com/tech/personal-tech/iphone-duo-broken-hinge-screen-31b2b28a\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">원문 기사 보기</a></p>\n</footer>\n</article>",
